# The published descriptor is the authoritative source for the upstream
# endpoint, mapping pin, capabilities and limits. The LEGACY_BASE_URL and
# LEGACY_INVOKE_PATH variables remain only as a development fallback for a
# descriptor that predates the endpoint field.
# 已发布 Descriptor 是上游地址、映射固定、能力与限额的权威来源。
# LEGACY_BASE_URL / LEGACY_INVOKE_PATH 仅作为未携带 endpoint 字段的旧描述符的开发回退。
APP_ENV=production
AGENT_ID=pre-registered-legacy-agent
ADAPTER_DESCRIPTOR=/etc/lexagent/descriptor.json
# The descriptor also pins plan_path (the registered signed mapping plan the
# runtime loads and re-verifies) and plan_public_key (the ed25519 key that plan
# must be signed with). Refresh failures keep the last-known-good revision.
# Descriptor 还固定 plan_path（运行时加载并重新校验的已登记签名映射计划）与
# plan_public_key（计划必须使用的 ed25519 公钥）。刷新失败保留 LKG 版本。
PLAN_REFRESH_SECONDS=60
LEGACY_BASE_URL=https://legacy-agent.example.internal
LEGACY_INVOKE_PATH=/api/ask
